
If u want to see the live changes via running kubectl so u can assign the watch statement with it

- watch kubectl get pods -n mysql-dev


For RBAC :-
- kubectl auth whoami => This will tell you about the current user
- kubectl auth whoami
ATTRIBUTE                                           VALUE
Username                                            kubernetes-admin
Groups                                              [kubeadm:cluster-admins system:authenticated]
